     tooltip="When on, every accepted entry and every exit (TP1/TP2, ATR stop, time stop, session close) fires a descriptive alert() message -- BULLISH ENTRY / BEARISH ENTRY, LONG EXIT / SHORT EXIT. When off, entries/exits still happen and the alertcondition() rows below still fire, but no alert() message is sent -- which looks identical to a broken alert if you forget this is off.",
     group=GRP_ALERTS)

